CREATE TABLE "RemoteLesson" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"ownerReference" TEXT NOT NULL,"ownerId" TEXT,"courseId" TEXT,"courseSnapshot" JSONB NOT NULL,"academicYear" TEXT NOT NULL,"term" TEXT NOT NULL,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"instructions" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"startsAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"endsAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'SCHEDULED',"roomName" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"revision" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,"startedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"endedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "RemoteLesson_ownerId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("ownerId") REFERENCES "User"("id") ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "RemoteLesson_courseId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("courseId") REFERENCES "Course"("id") ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "RemoteLesson_time_check" CHECK ("endsAt">"startsAt"),CONSTRAINT "RemoteLesson_status_check" CHECK ("status" IN ('SCHEDULED','LIVE','ENDED','CANCELLED')));
CREATE INDEX "RemoteLesson_courseId_academicYear_startsAt_idx" ON "RemoteLesson"("courseId","academicYear","startsAt");
CREATE INDEX "RemoteLesson_ownerReference_startsAt_idx" ON "RemoteLesson"("ownerReference","startsAt");
CREATE TABLE "RemoteConnection" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"connectionSid" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"lessonId" TEXT NOT NULL,"userReference" TEXT NOT NULL,"userId" TEXT,"joinedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"leftAt" TIMESTAMP(3),CONSTRAINT "RemoteConnection_lessonId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY("lessonId") REFERENCES "RemoteLesson"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "RemoteConnection_userId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY("userId") REFERENCES "User"("id") ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "RemoteConnection_lessonId_userReference_idx" ON "RemoteConnection"("lessonId","userReference");
CREATE TABLE "RemoteResource" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"lessonId" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"mime" TEXT NOT NULL,"bytes" BYTEA NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "RemoteResource_lessonId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY("lessonId") REFERENCES "RemoteLesson"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "RemoteWebhookEvent" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "AssignmentDraft" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"ownerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"courseId" TEXT NOT NULL,"payload" JSONB NOT NULL,"revision" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "AssignmentDraft_ownerId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY("ownerId") REFERENCES "User"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "AssignmentDraft_courseId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY("courseId") REFERENCES "Course"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "AssignmentDraft_ownerId_courseId_updatedAt_idx" ON "AssignmentDraft"("ownerId","courseId","updatedAt");

ALTER TABLE "Assignment" ADD COLUMN "publicationKey" TEXT;
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Assignment_publicationKey_key" ON "Assignment"("publicationKey");

ALTER TABLE "RemoteLesson" ADD COLUMN "blockedUserIds" TEXT[] NOT NULL DEFAULT ARRAY[]::TEXT[];
